  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", "1"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "fb2397b3-2acd-4a6f-bd14-8ccea7941719"],
 "-eigenspace projector to the flattened coefficient vector and reshape back, \
and compare with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
