Cell["\<\
The sections above sit on top of these sixteen calls. Anywhere a \
symmetry-resolved tensor network needs sizing, block enumeration, or \
constraint enforcement, the right call is one of them.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e889434b-91ac-44fd-81d2-9e375cff35da"]
